title: 'Add Interweb Polkadot WebRTC, TCP and WSS bootnodes'

doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    Adds four Interweb IT bootnode multiaddrs to the embedded Polkadot relay
    chainspec (`polkadot/node/service/chain-specs/polkadot.json`):
    WebRTC and TCP on 195.144.22.130:13012, DNS TCP on
    boot.interweb-it.com:13012, and DNS WSS on boot.interweb-it.com:13016.
    Peer ID 12D3KooWRjHFApinuqSBjoaDjQHvxwubQSpEVy5hrgC9Smvh92WF.
    No crate API or runtime code changes.

crates:
- name: polkadot-service
  bump: none
